  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/358",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#10084;&#65039;<a href=\"http://bit.ly/성적기록\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">앱링크: bit.ly/성적기록</a></span></b><br><br>1, 2학년은 곧 2차 지필이네요.<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">성적관리가 잘 안되는 학생</span></b>들이 있으면<br><b>꾸준히 본인 성적 기록이라도 하면</b><br>좀 나을까 ㅎㅎㅎ 싶어서요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bef557314569bc1946aeac164c8ec6bbd8f25a46\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"143\" height=\"118\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bef557314569bc1946aeac164c8ec6bbd8f25a46\" data-origin-width=\"258\" data-origin-height=\"213\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아, 물론....<br>시켜도 할까싶긴합니다 ㅠㅠ<br>&#160;<br>폰에 <b><span style=\"color: #0070D1;\">bit.ly/성적기록</span></b> 접속 후<br><b>아무 브라우져나 [홈화면]으로</b> 해서<br><b>[아이콘]으로 만들어 놓으면 끝!</b><br>&#160;<br>그건 그냥 메모잖아요~~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eac2a25bf7a403ba39cacf3ea5ebdaf95f7c2106\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"155\" height=\"132\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eac2a25bf7a403ba39cacf3ea5ebdaf95f7c2106\" data-origin-width=\"266\" data-origin-height=\"227\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>이 앱의 핵심은<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">학기초 &lt;평가계획서&gt; 이미지 1장</span></b>이면<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">평가항목의 이름, 비율이 자동입력</span></b>됩니다.&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/513f28ee88161d45bd3dfb2d78bc0956c3466892\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"264\" height=\"125\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/513f28ee88161d45bd3dfb2d78bc0956c3466892\" data-origin-width=\"366\" data-origin-height=\"173\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5199d73d5e752eb7ff61f2bb10dbcc6bdc71d9ec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5199d73d5e752eb7ff61f2bb10dbcc6bdc71d9ec\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"592\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">극단적인 ㅋㅋㅋ <b>이과생</b>&#160;^^;;;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e2553eb276e72f19f54da4e0e6c198bba6293b1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"163\" height=\"154\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e2553eb276e72f19f54da4e0e6c198bba6293b1\" data-origin-width=\"226\" data-origin-height=\"214\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ee0704e11e383406bda09320beb3cf05938b82e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ee0704e11e383406bda09320beb3cf05938b82e\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"533\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">왼쪽 3줄</span></b>에서 <b>학기를 고를 수&#160; 있고</b><br><b>&lt;과목별 변화보기&gt;</b>로 들어가면<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/077150d00629b6102473d3b1241584ec5f07ec46\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/077150d00629b6102473d3b1241584ec5f07ec46\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"592\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2학년 2학기에 <b>도대체 머선일</b>이??!!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f90d4e38462391153dc5f104c85aeec222f68c9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"152\" height=\"146\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f90d4e38462391153dc5f104c85aeec222f68c9\" data-origin-width=\"386\" data-origin-height=\"370\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ad9d8ad50095c4e0a0df5b4f8eb6da34081ee14\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ad9d8ad50095c4e0a0df5b4f8eb6da34081ee14\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"592\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>그래프 <b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">기본은 &lt;지필 점수 변화&gt;</span></b>이고<br><b>수행은 수행이라 뜹니다.</b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b649c9c513907b69382d0557b31e24df925e7c06\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b649c9c513907b69382d0557b31e24df925e7c06\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1811\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>우상단 <b>&lt;톱니바퀴&gt;</b>에 가면<br><b>&lt;평가항목&amp;비율 자동 입력&gt;</b>을<br>할 수 있는데요.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97e56ed5fdb62dd14fcf5a6eb721680794418045\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"147\" height=\"136\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97e56ed5fdb62dd14fcf5a6eb721680794418045\" data-origin-width=\"248\" data-origin-height=\"229\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">설정화면이 좀 복잡하죠 ㅎㅎ<br>&#160;<br>필요한건<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">학기초 배포되는</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">아래 같은 &lt;평가계획서&gt; 1장</span></b><br>pdf는 인식률이 떨어집니다.<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">반드시 &lt;평가계획서 이미지 파일&gt;을</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\"> 추천</span></b>합니다.&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ff52ff0aa44a0553909d8687372bf9b6374753d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ff52ff0aa44a0553909d8687372bf9b6374753d\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"388\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>연초 이알리미나 학교알리미의<br>&lt;학업성취사항&gt; 파일 등에 있습니다.<br>단언컨데 이미지!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a0dcb986051f6d5709130ef15d666c725a0145e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"330\" height=\"189\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a0dcb986051f6d5709130ef15d666c725a0145e\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"229\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">설명대로 <b>제미나이에 가서</b> 고고!<br>(안해보긴 했지만 AI라면<br>모두 가능할 것 같습니다.)<br>&lt;코드 입력창&gt;에 코드 넣으면,<br>비율과 내용 자동입력 끗!<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48f0dfa080b79c49362d6be5c4c3601816646a4e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48f0dfa080b79c49362d6be5c4c3601816646a4e\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"592\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><b>혹시 AI가 바보같이 인식</b>했다면<br>과목명 옆에&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52dd7a2aad2918d3f9b1041e256e5f6894adda48\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52dd7a2aad2918d3f9b1041e256e5f6894adda48\" data-origin-width=\"209\" data-origin-height=\"93\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">펜 눌러서 수정</span></b>하시면 되세요.<br>&#160;<br><b>모든 기록은 로컬</b>이라.<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">내폰에 브라우져 캐쉬에 저장</span></b>되는 것인데<br>&#160;<br>브라우져 앱을 삭제하거나<br>폰이 바뀌면 어떻게?!?!?!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c4658a504de41b4906f70dc82007368108f8643\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"147\" height=\"128\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c4658a504de41b4906f70dc82007368108f8643\" data-origin-width=\"228\" data-origin-height=\"198\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">그럼 사전에&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/503687cfb048a5e9b62926f2cba8b5bc8a5ad504\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"339\" height=\"140\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/503687cfb048a5e9b62926f2cba8b5bc8a5ad504\" data-origin-width=\"834\" data-origin-height=\"345\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>&lt;전체 데이터 복사&gt;</b> 해서<br>메모장, 카톡 어디든 저장해놓으면 됩니다.<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">애 폰에 자료 입력하고&#160;</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">부모님 폰에 &lt;전체 데이터 복사&gt; 하면&#160;</span></b><br>클릭 한번으로 같은 자료를 볼 수 있습니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br>재과만에.....올리기 좀<br>거리가 있는 자료라<br>고민했는데<br>&#160;<br>담임쌤들 중이나<br>자녀에게 필요하실 수도 있겠다싶어<br>올려봅니다.<br>&#160;<br>엄청 심플한 앱인데<br>설명이 넘 길었네요. 하하하</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style6\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">앱 개발은 중독성은 있는데<br>피폐해지는 것 같네요.<br>&#160;<br>수정을 578번을 해도 모자란<br>이 느낌적인 느낌<br>&#160;<br>혹, 이상있거나 필요한 기능 댓글 주시면&#160;<br>가능하다면 넣어보겠습니다. 하하하<br>&#160;<br><b>무탈한 기말되세요&#128077;</b></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
